    expect(prompt).toMatch(/cleared by an exact-SHA QA under handoff Gate and sequence step 5 \(the checks and independence of step 1 applied to PR-1: a reviewer who is not you, your session or any session or agent it created or ran, nor the authors' sessions of pull request #3 named in \(1\) above or any session or agent either created or ran, in each case directly or through another session or agent, verifies that the SHA it clears is PR-1's live head when the QA starts and when it reports, and any later push voids it\) before the owner merges it while its head is that SHA and that SHA contains every step 3a change merged by then \(a step 3a change that merges after PR-1 and whose description says PR-1's code must change to follow it is implemented in a PR-1 follow-up pull request, cleared, merged and checked the same way, handoff Gate and sequence step 3a\):/);
